---
title: Dashboard, collectors, and live logs
date: '2026-06-16'
tags:
  - added
summary: Analytics, time-series, and eval APIs; real MCP/skills/topology collectors with SSE live log streaming; a health endpoint for the aylith-infra connector.
---

The dashboard became real this milestone — **analytics, time-series, and eval
endpoints**, agents resolvable by id-or-name, and a deploy route with surface
info. Behind it, the **MCP, skills, and topology collectors** now gather live
data, streamed to the UI over **SSE**, and a `GET /api/health` endpoint plugs
Bract into the aylith-infra dashboard.

**Editorial clarification, 8 September 2026:** the deployment route records a
local lifecycle; there is no production compute backend. The historical marketing
image and its “you're live” caption have been withdrawn from this page because
they also carried unsupported price and deployment claims. The original media
files are retained; this correction is not a new release or a new runtime test.
See [current capabilities](/projects/bract).
